          %p
          .num_remark
            %h6 Remark
            %p
              %strong (families of subgroups)
              %br/
              More generally, given a family
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ℱ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{F}
              of subgroups of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi G
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G
              which is closed under conjugation and taking subgroups one looks at the full subcategory
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
