              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Elmendorf%27s+theorem"} Elmendorf's theorem
              will still hold.
          %h2#equivariant_postnikov_tower Equivariant Postnikov tower
          %p
            Given a
            = succeed "," do
