                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G \curvearrowright X \,=\, G \curvearrowright \ast
              the point, its fundamental category (equivariant fundamental groupoid) according to Def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#EquivariantFundamentalGroupoid"}
              is the plain
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orbit+category"} orbit category
